<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Transpaco raises yr shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Transpaco raises yr shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		     20     vs    15</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    2.20     vs    1.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    3.10     vs    2.24</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.90     vs    0.60</p>
<p>    Finance costs	    2.08     vs    1.60</p>
<p>    Turnover		  74.94     vs    68.65</p>
<p>Full name: Transpaco Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said its recent expansion required substantial capital and although no major expenditure was expected in the future, it was considered prudent not to declare a dividend.</p>
<p>It said it was budgeting for a substantial improvement in results for the current financial year and expected to declare a divident at the end of the year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
